status GREEN -- cold 216 run, 211 green, 3 red, all three mine and all three closed: tracked_link (an unstaged shelf), stash_record (the unlanded lap), standing_equipment (the meta line). Hot 214 run, 210 green, 2 red, tree_moved=no -- log_file_claim and its meta line, closed by landing the recovered shelf. Re-run singly after the close: tracked_link, link_touch, shelf_link_touch, index_row_bound, log_has_a_row, stash_record, foundations_link, log_file_claim, two_rooms_doorway_touch, ascii_document, qa_report_card, prose_register, exec_bit, documented_room, banner_room, itinerary_account_shelf -- all GREEN. Pages B+ 88 and A 94.
recommend keep-going -- the anchor gap is the one buildable item I would take next: no guard in this tree resolves a heading anchor, and foundations_link, readme_reach, link_touch and tracked_link all strip one.
